#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:661
msgid ""
"The shipping phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the "
"billing phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Kolom nomor telepon alamat pengiriman mungkin ditetapkan sebagai \"wajib "
"diisi\" jika bagian alamat penagihan ditampilkan setelah bagian alamat "
"pengiriman, dan kolom nomor telepon alamat penagihan ditetapkan sebagai "
"\"wajib diisi\". Hal ini diperlukan untuk memastikan alamat pengiriman "
"dapat disalin ke alamat penagihan saat opsi tersebut dicentang; jika tidak, "
"pelanggan mungkin tidak dapat menyelesaikan proses checkout."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:687
msgid ""
"The billing phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the "
"shipping phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Kolom nomor telepon penagihan dapat ditetapkan sebagai \"wajib diisi\" jika "
"bagian alamat penagihan ditampilkan sebelum bagian alamat pengiriman, dan "
"kolom nomor telepon pengiriman ditetapkan sebagai \"wajib diisi\". Hal ini "
"diperlukan untuk memastikan alamat pengiriman dapat disalin ke alamat "
"penagihan saat opsi tersebut dicentang; jika tidak, pelanggan mungkin tidak "
"dapat menyelesaikan formulir pembayaran."

