#: inc/compat/plugins/compat-plugin-biteship.php:61
msgid ""
"The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the "
"Biteship plugin."
msgstr ""
"Fitur bidang pilihan yang disempurnakan selalu dinonaktifkan saat "
"menggunakan plugin Biteship."

#: inc/compat/plugins/compat-plugin-woocommerce-german-market.php:112
msgid ""
"The place order position is always set to \"Below the order summary\" when "
"using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal "
"checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary."
msgstr ""
"Posisi tombol \"Buat Pesanan\" selalu diatur ke \"Di bawah ringkasan "
"pesanan\" saat menggunakan German Market. Plugin tersebut mengharuskan "
"tombol \"Buat Pesanan\" dan kotak centang persyaratan hukum ditampilkan di "
"bawah ringkasan pesanan."

#: inc/compat/plugins/compat-plugin-woocommerce-germanized.php:243
msgid ""
"The place order position is always set to \"Below the order summary\" when "
"using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order "
"button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary."
msgstr ""
"Posisi tombol \"Lakukan Pemesanan\" selalu diatur ke \"Di bawah ringkasan "
"pesanan\" saat menggunakan Germanized for WooCommerce. Plugin tersebut "
"mengharuskan tombol \"Lakukan Pemesanan\" dan kotak centang persyaratan "
"hukum ditampilkan di bawah ringkasan pesanan."

